<title>UK: Credit Lyonnais set warrants on Hotel sector.</title>
<headline>Credit Lyonnais set warrants on Hotel sector.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Lyonnais Financial Products (Gurnsey) has issued 80 million American-style call warrants, on a basket of Hotel stocks including one share of Hong Kong &amp; Shanghai Hotels, four shares of Regal Hotels International Holdings, one share of Shangri-La Asia and one share of Sino Hotel (Holdings) lead manager Credit Lyonnais said.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one basket.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    KH$31.365		 PREMIUM	9.52 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     HK$0.9048		 GEARING	4.08 X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	30.OCT.97		 PAYDATE	18.NOV.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   HONG KONG		 MIN EXER LOT 20,000</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  HK$36.90</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
